      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.39,
      "end_seconds": 235.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.5,
      "end_seconds": 262.24,
      "duration_seconds": 11.74,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 80, weight 91 kilos, saturation 97 percent. And temp 36.8 degrees, respiratory rate 18, height 167 centimetres, blood pressure 115 over 79."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.63,
      "end_seconds": 277.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.14,
      "text": "putting together what you've described, my working impression is thin bones with a fragility fracture and back pain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.29,
      "end_seconds": 281.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.22,
      "end_seconds": 302.91,
      "duration_seconds": 20.69,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now thin bones with a fragility fracture and back pain is my leading thought, not anything worse let me repeat that back to make sure you've had a stooped back for about a month, and no bladder problems or night pain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.45,
      "end_seconds": 305.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "that's what happened yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.18,
      "end_seconds": 344.7,
      "duration_seconds": 20.52,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a spine X-ray for back pain take the weekly tablet first thing with a full glass of water and stay upright for half an hour come back in six weeks that's everything on my side anything you're unsure about?"
    },
